<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="KR5c0126-en-6361769c" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>莊子譯注</title><editor role="translator">Wang Shishun 王世舜 et. al.</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>莊子譯注</title>濟南：山東教育出版社，1984</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#KR5c0126"><title xml:lang="och">莊子</title></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="zh">modern Chinese</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2025-09-02T03:10:35.754+09:00</date> by CH</creation><creation resp="#CH">Header modified: <date>2025-09-02T04:30:30.786+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="KR5c0126-start"><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-2a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T04:04:05.829+09:00">这就叫做能够和造化推移，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:52:06.516+09:00">了解生命的实际的，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:52:11.461+09:00">不去追求那些于生命无所补益的事情；</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:52:34.98+09:00">了解命运的实际的，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:52:41.27+09:00">不去追求那些本分以外的事情。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:52:45.688+09:00">必须用生活资料来保养形体，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:53:03.856+09:00">生活资料丰足有余而形体得不到养活的，这种情况是有的:</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:53:15.051+09:00">要保持生命，就必须先使生命不离开形体，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:54:53.136+09:00">形体虽然没有离开人世，而生命早已死亡了，这种情况也是有的。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:54:59.087+09:00">生命的到来不能拒绝，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:55:02.423+09:00">生命的消失不能阻止，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:55:06.564+09:00">可悲啊！</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:55:17.416+09:00">世俗的人以为保养形体就足以保存生命,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:55:21.692+09:00">然而如果保养形体实在不能够保存生命，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:55:46.098+09:00">那么，世俗的人又何必去做这种事情呢！</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:57:09.392+09:00">虽然不值得做这种事情，而又不可不去做它，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:57:55.042+09:00">那么人们做这些事情</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-2a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:58:13.264+09:00">如果要避免为形体操劳，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:58:04.053+09:00">就是不可避免的了。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-2a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:58:20.367+09:00">不如抛弃社会。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-2a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:58:27.278+09:00">抛弃了社会就没有累赘，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-2a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:58:37.868+09:00">没有累赘就走上了坦途，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-2a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:59:37.008+09:00">走上了坦途便和那个造化循环推移，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-2a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T03:59:48.383+09:00">能够和造化循环推移就算是接近于大道了。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-2a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T04:00:14.692+09:00">事务为什么要丢掉？生涯为什么要抛弃？</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-2a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T04:00:27.503+09:00">丢掉了事务，身体就不会操分，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-2a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T04:00:31.96+09:00">抛弃了生涯精神就不会亏损，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-2a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T04:02:06.415+09:00">保持着形体与精神的完好无缺</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-2a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T04:02:15.811+09:00">和自然融合为一。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-2a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T04:02:38.141+09:00">天和地，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-2a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T04:03:23.534+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-2a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T04:03:55.181+09:00">分散开来，便又成为另一种东西的开始。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-2a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T04:03:59.089+09:00">形体和精神不亏损，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-2a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T04:04:11.82+09:00">精神里面又有精神，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-2a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-02T04:04:12.107+09:00">这种精神反过来和自然相藕相成.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:05:28.804+09:00">光曜问无有说:</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:05:37.684+09:00">“先生您是存在呢？</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:05:51.408+09:00">还是不存在呢?”</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:06:03.312+09:00">光曜得不到回答，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:07:33.685+09:00">深远的样子,空空的样子。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:07:41.351+09:00">整天在观察，怎么也看不到；</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:07:49.429+09:00">整天在听，怎么也听不到；</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:08:01.21+09:00">整天在捕捉，怎么也捕捉不到。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:08:39.239+09:00">光曜说:</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:08:59.384+09:00">"真是最高的境界了，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:09:18.62+09:00">谁还能达到这样高的境界呢？</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:09:27.601+09:00">我可以达到有无的境界,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:09:35.402+09:00">然而却不能达到无无的境界，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-16a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:09:56.637+09:00">既然到了'无'的境界,而仍然不免于'有'，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_022-17a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T20:10:29.838+09:00">那怎么能够达到这样的境界呢?"</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>